<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Dec yr/yr CPI 2.3 pct, 1996 avge 1.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Dec yr/yr CPI 2.3 pct, 1996 avge 1.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details on Wednesday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	  DECEMBER    NOVEMBER     DEC 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	 0.0	  0.1	    -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     2.3	  2.3	     1.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    131.3	131.3	   128.3</p>
<p>				     1996	 1995</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation (avge)    1.9	  2.2</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    130.8	128.4</p>
<p>-- Janet McBride, Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-254</p>
</text>
